CONTEXT Permits IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Permits
{+ The included context consists of two files, which a plain INCLUDE joins.
The alias applies to the declarations of both files. +}

INCLUDE "../contexts/registry_in_two_files.adl" AS Reg

RELATION applicant[Permit*Reg.Person] [UNI]
RULE adult : applicant |- applicant;Reg.birthdate;Reg.birthdate~
ROLE Clerk MAINTAINS adult

ENDCONTEXT
